</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 287)</h2>
<p><b>Web review: pan when zoomed, full drawing parity, and honest voice notes.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Pan on the web: scroll or two-finger scroll pans when zoomed, pinch or &#8997;+scroll zooms at the cursor, &#8997;-drag or middle-drag pans, F fits — all shared with the room.</li>
<li>Web drawings now match the app: text notes render (wrapping inside their drag box), ellipses and fills draw properly, erase strokes work, and stroke widths are correct on every proxy resolution.</li>
<li>Voice notes stop pretending: failed transcriptions retry automatically, and after five attempts the note says so honestly instead of showing "transcribing…" forever.</li>
<li>Playlist shares bake each clip through its own color transform — an ACEScg sequence no longer exports through the movie clip's Rec.709.</li>
<li>Review links survive paste accidents (a link pasted after an existing one now loads).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
